  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "st_7a26cfc0fbf8",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The more you intimidate, the more you threaten, the more we’re going to end up supporting Ukraine,",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "commitment",
      "stance": 1,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_967358048c2d",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "What we have to understand is that these are not one-off attempts from the Russian side, but they are actually a campaign,",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "accusation",
      "stance": -2,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_d45e794cf105",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The aim of that campaign is to destabilize us mentally and otherwise, to make sure that we don’t support Ukraine.",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "accusation",
      "stance": -2,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_b166fa6f1a71",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The warfare that Russia is conducting in Ukraine is kinetic, traditional warfare, but what it’s conducting in Europe is hybrid,",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "accusation",
      "stance": -1,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_1366b5b1a1c0",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "Europe's response to Russian hybrid attacks should be attribution, resilience and consequences, with some responses public and others via private diplomatic channels, but the overall message must be that pressure on Europe means stronger support for Kyiv",
      "is_quote": false,
      "signal": "policy_announcement",
      "stance": 0,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_146eb29aa55a",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "Putin's war has achieved the opposite of its aims: Ukraine became European instead of Russian, NATO enlarged with Finland and Sweden joining, and European defense spending is rising toward 5%",
      "is_quote": false,
      "signal": "other",
      "stance": -1,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_e31ff17e5c3e",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "I think the power balance in Europe will be very different after the war is over to what it is now,",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "other",
      "stance": 1,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    },
    {
      "id": "st_fd4d7f37ed99",
      "speaker": "Alexander Stubb",
      "role": "President",
      "date": "2026-10-02",
      "text": "The Russian military was not capable of modern warfare when this war began, but now they are,",
      "is_quote": true,
      "signal": "warning",
      "stance": -1,
      "source_url": "https://www.kyivpost.com/post/86003"
    }
  ],
